purpose:"Give the analyst, the moment a ticket opens, the context that would otherwise take about twenty minutes to gather across different screens.\n\nThis is not about suggesting response text. The goal is to show what environment this is, what changed recently, what is failing right now, and which already-validated procedure applies to that symptom, with its historical success rate.\n\nThe main gain is margin: the more tickets resolved at the first level, the less escalation to the senior team, and the better the contract's cost structure.",status:"healthy",lastRunAt:"2026-10-07T06:42:00Z",metrics:[{id:"tickets",label:"Tickets assisted",value:"186"},{id:"context-time",label:"Context gathering",value:"2 min"}],displays:[{title:"What it reads and concludes",items:["States, before any lengthy investigation, whether the problem is in the client's environment, on the AWS platform, or a service limit.","Flags the recent change most likely to have caused the symptom, including changes on neighboring resources.","Shows the dominant error pattern and what equivalent cases needed to get resolved, with how long they took.","Flags when the same symptom has already repeated: the previous fix treated the effect, not the cause."]},{title:"Strategy it recommends",items:["Triage in a fixed order: platform, limit, change, log. The order rules out quickly what isn't the team's problem.","Assisted action, never automatic. The procedure comes with a preview and its success history, and requires approval.","Every resolved case feeds the knowledge base, so the next ticket starts further ahead."]}],nextSteps:["Execute the suggested procedure, with approval, and log the result.","Route to the RCA Agent when the likely cause is a change.","Open problem management when the symptom is recurring, instead of just closing the ticket.","Promote high-repetition, high-success-rate procedures to automation.","Log the monitoring gap when there was no alarm, feeding the SRE Agent."],deliverablePacka